TEST create_todo_validation_error

RECEIVE HTTP:POST /api/v1/todos
WITH {{payloads/create_todo_empty_title.json}}
HEADERS
  Authorization: Bearer valid_token_123

EXPECT HTTP:GET ${USER_SERVICE_URL}
HEADERS
  Authorization: Bearer valid_token_123
RETURNS {{payloads/authenticated_user.yaml}}

RESPOND HTTP:400
WITH {{payloads/error_title_required.json}}
